Subject: [guv v2 08/31] tracing: Replace __get_cpu_var uses
References: <20130826204351.725357339@linux.com>
X-SES-Outgoing: 2013.08.26-54.240.9.66
Sender: linux-kernel-owner@vger.kernel.org
